+---
+id: task-003-conform-applypatch-to-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Conform applyPatch to RFC 6902"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Review and correct `applyPatch` validation, operation semantics, edge cases, and errors to conform to RFC 6902. Ensure invalid patches and failed operations throw without mutating the input, and add coverage for the RFC behavior and error cases. Update the API documentation to explain the resulting behavior.
diff --git a/src/index.test.ts b/src/index.test.ts
